      "content": "but that's just subjective, isn't it? you're just saying we should make up our own meaning to avoid the void. if we're being purely logical and stripping away the emotion, you can't actually prove that \"creating meaning\" is better than just ending the cycle. if the math is neutral, then the choice to stop is just as valid as the choice to continue. it's just a logical move to stop the struggle when the outcome is essentially the same. don't you see that?",
